        { "visual": "Términos clave: Strengths (Fortalezas). Weaknesses (Debilidades). Skills (Habilidades). Hire (Contratar). Fire (Despedir). Apply for a job (Postularse a un empleo).", "audio": "Key terms for interviews. Strengths. Weaknesses. Skills. To hire means to give someone a job. To fire means to dismiss someone. And to apply for a job means to send your resume." }
